  "description": "<p>Be ready at a moment&rsquo;s notice with our Covert Ops Concealed Carry Soft Shell Jacket. The windproof and water-resistant CCW jacket provides ample protection from the elements while offering quick and efficient access to your firearm. Whether you are on-duty or out traveling, stay prepared with this everyday concealed carry jacket. CCW Design: Rothco&rsquo;s ambidextrous concealed carry pocket system features dual built-in pockets designed to safely and discretely holster firearms and personal accessories. In addition, each front slash zipper pocket has a zipper passthrough inside for waistband access. Ultimate Weather Defense: As part of Rothco&rsquo;s rugged Soft Shell series, the covert CCW jacket offers unparalleled versatility and durability. The lightweight, breathable, and weatherproof Soft Shell 2-layer material provides exceptional wind and water resistance while out in the field. In addition, the soft shell material features a polyester / spandex blend for improved mobility. Adjustable Design: The concealed carry weapon windbreaker jacket features adjustable hook &amp; loop wrist cuffs for finding the perfect fit while keeping light rain and wind out. Everyday Discretion: From undercover operations to casual outing, the undercover concealed carry coat is great for field missions, work, travel, outdoor activities, and more.</p>",
